---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { postReadTime } from '../../../lib/readTimes';
const readTime = postReadTime('tropd');
---
<BaseLayout
  title="TrOPD: Trust Region On-Policy Distillation for Stable SRM Training | AI/ML Deep Dives"
  description="On-Policy Distillation (OPD) for reasoning models suffers from training instability and policy-gradient outliers. TrOPD stabilizes learning using a Speculative-inspired trust region, outlier forward-KL estimation, and annealed off-policy guidance."
