<p>In all evaluation configurations, TrOPD consistently outperformed standard OPD and reinforcement learning baselines. Under single-domain math distillation, TrOPD achieved a **+3.06** point average accuracy gain over OPD. Furthermore, it outperformed REOPOLD, proving that combining speculative trust regions and top-k outlier forward KL is more effective than blind reward clipping.</p>

<h3>Ablation: The Contribution of Each Component</h3>
<p>To isolate the source of TrOPD's stability, the authors performed ablation studies in the math domain. Simply masking outlier gradients (**Mask Outlier**) improved performance over baseline OPD, showing the danger of uncorrected policy gradients. Switching outlier optimization to FKL (**FKL Outlier**) yielded further gains, which were maximized when combined with annealed off-policy guidance (**TrOPD FKL**).</p>

<table class="results-table">
